#, fuzzy
msgid "If you feel something is missing or have an article coming out for future Quarkus Newsletter posts please https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkusio.github.io/issues[open an issue] with a short description and a url."
msgstr "如果您觉得缺少了什么，或者有文章要发表，请在 \"Quarkus 时事通讯 \"上 link:https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkusio.github.io/issues[发表] ，并附上简短说明和网址。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "In this first edition I've gathered list of interesting publications since the launch of Quarkus back in March 2019."
msgstr "在这第一期中，我收集了自 Quarkus 于 2019 年 3 月推出以来发表的有趣出版物。"

